3950e3fdb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Wake up in Starnberg with the lake practically as your neighbor. In the morning, it’s the kind of place where you can grab a coffee, step outside, and be by Lake Starnberg within minutes—whether you’re going for a calm walk along the shore, a quick jog, or simply a deep breath of fresh air before the day begins.\n\nBack at the apartment, everything feels easy and practical—yet cozy. There’s a separate bedroom for restful nights, and in the living room a double sofa bed that comfortably sleeps two more guests, making the space ideal for up to 4 people. The dining area invites slow breakfasts and relaxed dinners—perfect after a day out exploring, working remotely, or visiting nearby Munich.\n\nOne of the loveliest corners of the home is the winter balcony (enclosed balcony / winter garden)—bright, peaceful, and usable year-round. It’s the perfect spot to read, journal, enjoy your morning tea, or just unwind while the day softens outside.\n\nThe kitchen is fully equipped for everyday cooking, whether you’re preparing something simple or putting together a proper meal. And the bathroom is clean and comfortable—everything you need, without fuss.\n\nAnd then there’s the location: you’re not only close to the lake, you’re also just a few meters from supermarkets and essentials, so you can arrive, settle in, and feel at home immediately—no car required, no complicated planning. Just a smooth, convenient stay with nature and city comfort side by side.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"v